            <p style="font-size:16px; font-family:Arial; line-height:30px; text-align:justify; color:black;">
               Arpit Samant is working as an Assistant Professor in the Department of Mechanical Engineering at Bharat Ratna Babasaheb Bhimrao Ambedkar Rajkiya Engineering College, Pratapgarh. His research interest includes, thermal and fluids engineering. Before joining at Bharat Ratna Babasaheb Bhimrao Ambedkar Rajkiya Engineering College, Pratapgarh, he has worked as Assistant Professor (Guest) in the Department of Mechanical Engineering at Kamla Nehru Institute of Technology, Sultanpur, U.P. He has completed his M. Tech in Thermal Engineering from Kamla Nehru Institute of Technology, Sultanpur, U.P.
            </p>

            @* <p style="font-size:16px; font-family:Arial; line-height:30px; text-align:justify; color:black;">
